NAME
       uname - print system information

SYNOPSIS
       uname [-amnrsv]

DESCRIPTION
       Prints the kernel name, and more with flags.

OPTIONS
       -a     everything below
       -m     machine hardware name
       -n     network node hostname
       -r     kernel release
       -s     kernel name (the default)
       -v     kernel version

SEE ALSO
       cpuinfo(1), meminfo(1)
